{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836954",
      "title": "Handling Loading States",
      "sourceHash": "77996d0ef5d83098788596155e9367aade91619498e872f0654a22eba4b1cf99",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.05,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "So fetching the data works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "but here's something you should try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "Go to your developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 10.623,
          "en": "and then there to the network tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.48,
          "end": 17.103,
          "en": "And now, there enable throttling and turn on slow 3G.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 21.06,
          "en": "If you do that and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.06,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "you'll see that the page takes some time to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "But then once it did load, you also see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "that it takes some time to fetch the places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "and I don't just mean the images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "Instead, if I do that again, we can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "that initially we see no places available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 41.643,
          "en": "until at some point of time the places data arrives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.48,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "And that's of course not really a great user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 48.93,
          "en": "It would be better if we would be showing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.93,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "some fallback here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "some fallback text or some loading text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 57.573,
          "en": "whilst we are waiting for the data to arrive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 62.16,
          "en": "Now, this places component indeed supports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.16,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "a fallback text prop here where we can set some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 68.086,
          "en": "in case we have no places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.086,
          "end": 71.367,
          "en": "But that's not really what I wanna show here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.367,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "because we might have places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "we just didn't fetch them yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "So I wanna show some separate loading text, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 85.65,
          "en": "where we could say fetching place data, dot, dot, dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 88.23,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 91.17,
          "en": "And at the moment, this places component does not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.17,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "support such a prop, but it would be nice if it would",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "and if it would then also have a prop like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "isLoading, where we could pass true as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "as long as we're waiting for the places to arrive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 108.363,
          "en": "and falls once the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "So inside of places JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 116.143,
          "en": "we should accept these two props isLoading and loadingText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.54,
          "end": 125.34,
          "en": "and then use these props to show some special output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.34,
          "end": 128.22,
          "en": "For example, here right below the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.22,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "of this category box here, we could check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "if isLoading is true, and if it is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 139.79,
          "en": "show a paragraph with a class name of fallback text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.13,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "for styling reasons, where inside of that paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 147.523,
          "en": "here we output our loadingText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 152.973,
          "en": "This could be our fallback if this isLoading prop is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 154.02,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "And on the other hand, I only want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 159.39,
          "en": "the other fallback text if we got no places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.39,
          "end": 163.65,
          "en": "or the places data if isLoading is not true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.65,
          "end": 166.65,
          "en": "So here we could check if not isLoading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 166.65,
          "end": 169.053,
          "en": "and places length equals zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 174.663,
          "en": "and if not isLoading and places length greater zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 180.06,
          "en": "With that, if we set isLoading to true here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 180.06,
          "end": 184.593,
          "en": "in available places, we see that fallback text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 188.67,
          "en": "But of course, this at the moment is not a great solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 188.67,
          "end": 191.64,
          "en": "because at the moment we always show that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 194.04,
          "en": "And instead of always showing this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 194.04,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "this should of course be controlled dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 199.753,
          "en": "and it should depend on the progress of our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 199.753,
          "end": 201.873,
          "en": "HTTP request here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 202.74,
          "end": 206.94,
          "en": "As long as it's on its way, this should be set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 210.273,
          "en": "And once the data is there, this should be set to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 214.86,
          "en": "And therefore when sending HTTP requests like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 217.8,
          "en": "it's quite common that you don't just wanna manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 217.8,
          "end": 221.37,
          "en": "the data that's going to arrive with state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 221.37,
          "end": 225.453,
          "en": "but that you also want to manage some loading state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 226.5,
          "end": 230.57999999999998,
          "en": "So some extra state that could be called isFetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 230.57999999999998,
          "end": 235.57999999999998,
          "en": "and setIsFetching, which initially is false, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 239.4,
          "en": "but which is set to true inside of this effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 239.4,
          "end": 240.93,
          "en": "function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 240.93,
          "end": 244.5,
          "en": "So that here we call setIsFetching and set this to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 244.5,
          "end": 247.173,
          "en": "because we're now starting to fetch places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 248.22,
          "end": 251.61,
          "en": "We therefore could also do that inside of fetchPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 251.61,
          "end": 252.933,
          "en": "Doesn't really matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 257.67,
          "en": "And then once we're done, once we've got the data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 257.67,
          "end": 259.41,
          "en": "we set this to false again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 259.41,
          "end": 261.813,
          "en": "because we're not fetching the data anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 263.82,
          "end": 266.07,
          "en": "Now, it might look like there are just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 266.07,
          "end": 269.31,
          "en": "three lines of code between these two state updates,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 269.31,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "but keep in mind that this step here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 274.77,
          "en": "can take a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 277.56,
          "en": "So there actually may be a couple of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 277.56,
          "end": 280.293,
          "en": "between these two lines of code being executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 281.73,
          "end": 285.03,
          "en": "And now we can use this isFetching state as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.03,
          "end": 289.35,
          "en": "for isLoading, so that it will either be true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.35,
          "end": 293.25,
          "en": "depending on whether we just started the HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 293.25,
          "end": 295.473,
          "en": "or we already got a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 296.73,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "And therefore, if you save this and you reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 300.15,
          "end": 303.18,
          "en": "with that network throttling still enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 303.18,
          "end": 305.31,
          "en": "you will of course see that again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 305.31,
          "end": 307.77,
          "en": "fetching the React code takes some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.77,
          "end": 310.14,
          "en": "But that, once it's there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.14,
          "end": 312.21,
          "en": "we see that fallback loading text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 312.21,
          "end": 315.603,
          "en": "and then the actual place data eventually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.8,
          "end": 319.65,
          "en": "And with that, I'll disable that throttling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.65,
          "end": 323.64,
          "en": "but this is how you can display such a loading state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.64,
          "end": 325.83299999999997,
          "en": "based on your data fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}